      "annotation_text": "Tests and procedures should be performed within the specified windows for all visits. If extenuating circumstances prevent a patient from completing a scheduled procedure or assessment within this time, the patient may continue the study only with the written permission of the medical monitor. If a patient is not able to visit the study site, then a telehealth visit should be considered to ensure appropriate oversight and safety monitoring. In addition to this, if the patient is able to visit a local doctor and/or laboratory, then appropriate assessments may be performed at a local laboratory or doctor’s office, per investigator discretion.",
